    "body": "### Problem\n\nNeovim and all associated language servers survive terminal exit if the session was restarted with `ZR`/`:restart`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nnvim --clean\nZR\nkill terminal (with nvim running)\nlist running processes (eg `pgrep nvim` or `ps -a`)\n\nobserve nvim pid (any attached LS also survive)\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nnvim and associated LS should die once terminal is killed\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\n0.12.5\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nLinux 7.2.8\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nkitty 0.49.2\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-kitty\n\n### Installation\n\npacman",
